# DigiSwasthya Product Definition Document (PDD)

# Part 11 — Permissions Matrix

---

# Purpose

This section defines who can do what inside DigiSwasthya at a deeper level than primary roles.

Primary business roles:

- Pharmacy
- Stockist
- Platform Administrator

Within a business, users may hold operational roles:

- Owner
- Manager
- Staff
- Delivery Boy
- Accountant
- Support (platform)

Permissions are evaluated as:

```
Business Type Role ∩ Operational Role ∩ Explicit Grants/Revocations ∩ Business Status ∩ Entity Status
```

If any layer denies the action, the action is denied.

---

# Permission Verbs

- View
- Create
- Edit
- Delete / Discard
- Approve
- Reject
- Cancel
- Export
- Assign
- Configure

Not every verb applies to every capability.

---

# Legend

- Y = Allowed
- N = Denied
- C = Conditional (see notes)
- O = Owner only
- A = Admin only

