# 6. Status-Based Permission Gates

| Business/Entity Status | Effect |
|---|---|
| Business unverified | No trade Create/Accept/Pay settlement initiation |
| Business suspended | No new trade; view history allowed |
| Connection not Active | No browse private pricing/order create |
| Order Closed/Cancelled/Rejected | No operational edits |
| Invoice Locked/Paid | No void by normal users |
| Payment Approved | No casual edit |
| Batch Expired/Recalled | No allocate/dispatch sellable |
| User Suspended/Removed | No actions |

